:null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The farm is map-listed; participation and entry depend on current college programming.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"claremont-colleges-ballroom-dance-company","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"The Claremont Colleges Ballroom Dance Company","title":"Look for a Ballroom Dance Company event","subtitle":"A recurring performance and formal-ball activity","notes":"Check campus listings for a public lesson, performance, or formal ball and follow the organizer’s attendance instructions. It is a structured way to try a social campus activity.","short_summary":"A documented Claremont Colleges dance activity.","evidence_claim":"Pomona says The Claremont Colleges Ballroom Dance Company often presents performances and formal balls.","source_url":"https://www.pomona.edu/life-at-pomona/campus-events","source_title":"Campus Events","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Schedules, locations, and participation requirements vary by event.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"claremont-farmers-market","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Claremont Farmers Market","title":"Finish with Sunday market browsing","subtitle":"Harvard Avenue in Claremont Village","notes":"On Sunday morning, walk the market route on Harvard Avenue and browse produce, plants, and artisan stalls. Bring a payment method only if you intend to buy something.","short_summary":"A Sunday Claremont Village market with farm and artisan vendors.","evidence_claim":"The market’s official site lists Sunday hours of 8 a.m.–1 p.m., rain or shine, on Harvard Avenue between First Street and Bonita Avenue.","source_url":"https://www.claremontfarmersmarket.com/","source_title":"Claremont Farmers Market","source_kind":"business_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latit